    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Prompt Engineering: Techniques & Patterns Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Prompt Template Library"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Define 10 reusable prompt patterns as structured data. Each pattern has a name, template, variables, and recommended settings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "PROMPT_PATTERNS = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"persona\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Persona Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"You are {role} with {experience}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Your communication style is {style}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"You prioritize {priority}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"{task}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"role\", \"experience\", \"style\", \"priority\", \"task\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.7,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Activates a specific expert distribution in the model's training data\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"few_shot\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Few-Shot Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Here are examples of the expected input/output format:\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"{examples}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Now process this input:\\n{input}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"examples\", \"input\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Provides concrete examples to anchor the output format and style\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"chain_of_thought\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Chain-of-Thought Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Think through this step by step.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Problem: {problem}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Steps:\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"1. Identify the key components\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"2. Analyze each component\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"3. Synthesize your findings\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"4. State your conclusion\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Show your reasoning before giving the final answer.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"problem\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.3,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Forces explicit reasoning steps before the final answer\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"template_fill\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Template Fill Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Extract information from the following text and fill in the template.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Text: {text}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Template:\\n{template_structure}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Fill in every field. If information is not available, write 'N/A'.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"text\", \"template_structure\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Constrains output to a specific structure with named fields\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"critique\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Critique Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Task: {task}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Step 1: Generate an initial response.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Step 2: Critique your response for accuracy, completeness, and clarity.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Step 3: Produce an improved final version.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Label each step clearly.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"task\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.5,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Self-refinement through explicit critique before final output\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"guardrail\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Guardrail Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"You are a {role}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Rules:\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- ONLY answer questions about {domain}\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- If the question is outside {domain}, say: 'This is outside my scope.'\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- NEVER make up information. If unsure, say 'I don't know.'\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- {additional_rules}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"User question: {question}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"role\", \"domain\", \"additional_rules\", \"question\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.3,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Constrains the model to a specific domain with explicit boundaries\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"meta_prompt\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Meta-Prompt Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Write a prompt for an LLM that will {objective}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"The prompt should include:\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- A specific role/persona\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- Clear constraints and output format\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- 2-3 few-shot examples\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- Edge case handling\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Optimize the prompt for {metric}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Target model: {model}.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"objective\", \"metric\", \"model\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.7,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Uses the LLM to generate optimized prompts for other tasks\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"decomposition\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Decomposition Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Problem: {problem}\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Break this into sub-problems:\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"1. List each sub-problem\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"2. Solve each independently\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"3. Combine sub-solutions into a final answer\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"4. Verify the final answer against the original problem\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"problem\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.3,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Breaks complex problems into manageable pieces\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"audience_adapt\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Audience Adaptation Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Explain {concept} for the following audience: {audience}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Constraints:\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- Use vocabulary appropriate for {audience}\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- Length: {length}\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- Include {include}\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"- Exclude {exclude}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"concept\", \"audience\", \"length\", \"include\", \"exclude\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.5,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Adapts explanation complexity to the target audience\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"boundary\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"name\": \"Boundary Pattern\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"template\": ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"You are an assistant that ONLY handles {scope}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"If the user's request is within scope, help them fully.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"If the user's request is outside scope, respond exactly with:\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"'{refusal_message}'\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"Do not attempt to answer out-of-scope questions.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"User: {user_input}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"variables\": [\"scope\", \"refusal_message\", \"user_input\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": 0.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"description\": \"Hard boundary on what the model will and will not respond to\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Prompt Builder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build prompts from patterns by filling in variables and assembling the full message structure (system + user + optional prefill)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def build_prompt(pattern_name, variables, system_override=None):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    pattern = PROMPT_PATTERNS.get(pattern_name)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if not pattern:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown pattern: {pattern_name}. Available: {list(PROMPT_PATTERNS.keys())}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    missing = [v for v in pattern[\"variables\"] if v not in variables]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if missing:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        raise ValueError(f\"Missing variables for {pattern_name}: {missing}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    rendered = pattern[\"template\"].format(**variables)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    system = system_override or f\"You are an AI assistant using the {pattern['name']}.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"system\": system,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"user\": rendered,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": pattern[\"temperature\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"pattern\": pattern_name,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"metadata\": {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"description\": pattern[\"description\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"variables_used\": list(variables.keys()),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def build_multi_turn(pattern_name, turns, system_override=None):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    pattern = PROMPT_PATTERNS.get(pattern_name)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if not pattern:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown pattern: {pattern_name}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    system = system_override or f\"You are an AI assistant using the {pattern['name']}.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    messages = [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": system}]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for role, content in turns:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        messages.append({\"role\": role, \"content\": content})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"messages\": messages,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"temperature\": pattern[\"temperature\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"pattern\": pattern_name,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Try it: build a prompt from a pattern"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This block runs in your browser. Change the values in `variables` \u2014 for example"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "swap the `role`, `priority`, or `task` \u2014 and press **Run** to see the assembled"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "prompt the model would actually receive. No API key needed; this is pure prompt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "assembly, the same logic `build_prompt` uses above."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python editable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# A consulting-style Persona Pattern. Edit any value and press Run."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "template = ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"You are {role} with {experience}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"Your communication style is {style}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"You prioritize {priority}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"{task}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "variables = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"role\": \"a senior technology consultant\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"experience\": \"12 years advising on enterprise AI architecture\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"style\": \"direct, evidence-based, no hype\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"priority\": \"business value and operational risk over novelty\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"task\": \"Review the proposed RAG architecture and flag the top 3 risks.\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "prompt = template.format(**variables)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(\"=== ASSEMBLED PROMPT ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(prompt)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(\"Characters:\", len(prompt))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Exercise: fill in the blanks, then watch it render"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Now you do it. Fill in the five blanks to complete a consulting **Persona"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Pattern**, then press **Run** \u2014 the code assembles your prompt and draws a live"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "visual report of its structure, token estimate, and how complete the pattern is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Stuck on a blank? Press **Fill it in for me** and it drops in one valid set of"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "answers and runs immediately. Empty blanks are allowed too \u2014 Run anyway and watch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "the completeness meter climb as you fill them in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python fillin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Fill each blank with a string value for the persona prompt."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "role     = \"{{blank:a senior technology consultant}}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "priority = \"{{blank:business value and operational risk}}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "tone     = \"{{blank:direct}}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "audience = \"{{blank:the client's CTO}}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "task     = \"{{blank:Review the proposed RAG architecture and name the top 3 risks}}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "template = ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"You are {role}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"You prioritize {priority}.\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"Speak in a {tone} tone for {audience}.\\n\\n\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"Task: {task}\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "prompt = template.format(role=role, priority=priority, tone=tone,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                         audience=audience, task=task)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# --- analyze the prompt ---"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "lines  = prompt.split(\"\\n\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "words  = prompt.split()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "tokens = max(1, round(len(prompt) / 4))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "values = (role, priority, tone, audience, task)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "filled = sum(1 for v in values if v.strip())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "score  = round(100 * filled / len(values))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def bar(pct, width=24):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n = round(width * pct / 100)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return \"\u2588\" * n + \"\u2591\" * (width - n)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "W = 56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "line = \"\u2550\" * W"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def row(s=\"\"):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return \"\u2551 \" + s[:W - 2].ljust(W - 2) + \" \u2551\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(\"\u2554\" + line + \"\u2557\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(row(\"PROMPT PATTERN VISUALIZER\".center(W - 2)))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(\"\u2560\" + line + \"\u2563\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "for ln in prompt.split(\"\\n\"):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if ln.strip() == \"\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(row())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i in range(0, len(ln), W - 4):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(row(\"\u2502 \" + ln[i:i + W - 4]))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(\"\u2560\" + line + \"\u2563\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(row(\"Lines: %-3d Words: %-3d ~Tokens: %d\" % (len(lines), len(words), tokens)))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(row(\"Slots filled: %d/%d\" % (filled, len(values))))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(row(\"Completeness \" + bar(score) + \" %d%%\" % score))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(\"\u255a\" + line + \"\u255d\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "if score == 100:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n\u2705 Pattern complete \u2014 ready to send to the model.\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n\u26a0 Some slots are still empty \u2014 fill them in and re-run.\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Multi-Model Testing Harness"
